\Section{Implications for the operating plan}
The more durable group supports a longer relationship and a different cash-recovery profile. The less durable group may still be attractive at an appropriate acquisition cost, with a service proposition suited to its shorter use cycle. Product and Marketing can distinguish immediate task completion from ongoing capability development when designing onboarding and renewal communications.
